ME.-","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":125.5917232021709,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":192.99999999999994,"r":387.52799999999996,"t":134.81999999999994},"charspan":[0,38],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/14","text":"''(5) MODIFIED ADJUSTED GROSS INCOME.-"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(A)  IN GENERAL.-The  term  'modified  adjusted  gross income'  means  adjusted  gross  income  determined  without regard to the amounts described in subparagraph (B).","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":95.5917232021709,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":193.004,"r":471.01399999999984,"t":124.81999999999994},"charspan":[0,170],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/15","text":"''(A)  IN GENERAL.-The  term  'modified  adjusted  gross income'  means  adjusted  gross  income  determined  without regard to the amounts described in subparagraph (B)."},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(B)  CERTAIN AMOUNTS DISREGARDED.-An  amount  is described in this subparagraph if it is-","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":75.5917232021709,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":193.0,"r":470.9099999999999,"t":94.81999999999994},"charspan":[0,91],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/16","text":"''(B)  CERTAIN AMOUNTS DISREGARDED.-An  amount  is described in this subparagraph if it is-"},{"children":[],"content_layer":"body","label":"text","orig":"''(i)  the  amount  of  losses  from  sales  or  exchanges of  capital  assets  in  excess  of  gains  from  such  sales or exchanges to the extent such amount does not exceed the amount under section 1211(b)(1),","parent":{"$ref":"#/body"},"prov":[{"bbox":{"b":35.59172320217101,"coord_origin":"BOTTOMLEFT","l":213.0,"r":471.1499999999997,"t":74.81999999999994},"charspan":[0,212],"page_no":1}],"self_ref":"#/texts/17","text":"''(i)  the  amount  of  losses  from  sales  or  exchanges of  capital  assets  in  excess  of  gains  from  such  sales or exchanges to the extent such 